	"Description": "Scarecrow recolor inspired by Chanel runway fashion\n<br />\n<br />Install either the CP or the JA version, of course you can install both but i dont see the point of that XD.\n<br />\n<br />For the CP version, you can either use\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/5098]Generic Mod Config Menu[/url]\uFEFF or edit the config,json file to change which animal you want to use for each scarecrow/rarecrow/deluxe scarecrow.\u00A0\n<br />The\u00A0recipes for the JA version should be already unlocked, and should be the same as vanilla scarecrows.\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />Default: \n<br />\u00A0 Scarecrow: deer\n<br />\u00A0 Rarecrow1: swan\n<br />\u00A0 Rarecrow2: lion\n<br />\u00A0 Rarecrow3: bunny\n<br />\u00A0 Rarecrow4: cheetah\n<br />\u00A0 Rarecrow5: panda\n<br />\u00A0 Rarecrow6: horse\n<br />\u00A0 Rarecrow7: polarbear\n<br />\u00A0 Rarecrow8: wolf\n<br />\u00A0 Deluxecrow: antelope\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />香奈儿走秀款福瑞稻草人（不是）\n<br />\n<br />有CP和JA两个格式，二选一下载。当然也可以两个都下，不过没啥必要hhhh\n<br />CP版可以用\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/5098]Generic Mod Config Menu[/url]\u00A0或者自己编辑config,json分配哪个动物替换哪个稻草人。\n<br />JA版的配方应该是直接解锁的，所需素材和普通稻草人一样。\n<br />\n<br />默认:\n<br />普通稻草人: 鹿\n<br />稀有稻草人1: 天鹅\n<br />稀有稻草人2: 狮子\n<br />稀有稻草人3: 兔子\n<br />稀有稻草人4: 猎豹\n<br />稀有稻草人5: 熊猫\n<br />稀有稻草人6: 马\n<br />稀有稻草人7: 北极熊\n<br />稀有稻草人8: 狼\n<br />豪华稻草人: 羚羊\n<br />\n<br />严禁二传和盗卖\n<br />\n<br />小红书：科林\u00A0 \u00A0261392706\n<br />b站：科林·Bschmt",
